1.0.1 2026-11-18
  - 17 sub-*/ses-1/nirs/*_channels.tsv: channel names written as MNE-Python derives them from the SNIRF measurement list ("S1-D1-760.0" -> "S1_D1 760"); row order and the other columns unchanged; type MISC -> NIRSCWAMPLITUDE (SNIRF dataType 1); Windows line endings removed
  - 17 *_coordsystem.json: NIRSCoordinateSystemDescription added (BIDS requires it when NIRSCoordinateSystem is Other); Windows line endings removed
  - 17 *_nirs.json: Manufacturer from the SNIRF tag ManufacturerName (NIRx Medizintechnik GmbH); ManufacturersModelName "NIRSport2 (four cascaded 16x16 devices for HD)" (doi:10.1117/1.NPh.12.3.035010, section 2.2.2 Hardware); RecordingDuration and RecordingType computed from the SNIRF time vector of each recording; the files, published on a single line, are rewritten with one key per line (published values unchanged)
  - participants.tsv, participants.json, 17 optodes.tsv and 14 events.tsv: Windows line endings removed; values unchanged
  - sourcedata/: the published versions of the files whose values change in this version (17 channels.tsv), byte-identical at the same relative path (plain git files)
  - README.md: new section "Contributed notes (version 1.0.1)"
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
